text_01E6:
    string "留年大嫌いィ～！！"                    ; en: I hate repeating a year~!!

text_01F9:
    string "このままどこかでランデブー"                ; en: A rendezvous somewhere just like this

text_0214:
    string "星占いのうそつきィ～"                   ; en: Horoscopes are liars~

text_0229:
    string "みんな！%NMYのお店に%Kバリバリ止まってねぇ☆"    ; en: Everyone! Stop at / <player>'s stores a lot ☆

